          "items": [
            "Mystic Cottage by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Recently renovated, Mystic Cottage is a wonderful beach house in Inlet Beach. With multiple beach accesses, take advantage of this great location with a paddleboarding or kayaking adventure in Camp Helen State Park. Or take a beach hike to the park. Very nice! Or venture to one of South Walton’s snorkeling reefs. Each is shaped like a unique marine creature, a wonderful world beneath the waves.<br> <br>Highlights:<br>⛱️ Inlet Beach<br>👣 .3 miles to the Lupine Beach Access<br>👙 Private pool/Shared pool with sister home (Hideaway Cottage)<br>🐶 Dog-friendly<br>↕️ Elevator<br>🏝️ 3rd-floor large balcony/deck, seating, dining table, swing, great views!<br>🍹 Second-floor large balcony/deck, outdoor seating, dining table<br>🚲 4 bikes!<br>🍤 Gas grill<br>🚿 Outdoor shower, hammocks<br>🕶️ Near Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach<br>🦞 4-star restaurants<br>🛍️ Boutiques<br> <br>Explore the neighborhood with old Florida charm, eclectic restaurants, and boutique shops. When seeking a laid-back meal or a special occasion dining experience, Inlet Beach’s food scene won’t disappoint.<br> <br>Outside, a spacious private pool area, shared with its sister home, Hideaway Cottage, invites all for a refreshing dip. Other amenities include an outdoor shower, and inviting hammocks.<br> <br>Inside, the first floor features a stackable washer and dryer, a small dining table for four, a full bathroom, and an elevator that leads to the second and third floors.<br> <br>The second floor features a cozy living room, with a pull-out queen sofa and a smart TV, three dreamy bedrooms, and an office area. Outside, a sprawling wrap-around balcony/deck offers ample seating.<br> <br>The third floor includes another spacious living room, dining area, and kitchen with stainless-steel appliances. Enjoy the third-floor views, lots of windows too! A sprawling wraparound balcony/deck offers Gulf glimpses and ample seating, including a dining table, rocking chairs, and a porch swing. Grill your favorite meals on the Weber grill.<br> <br>Your beach getaway begins at Mystic Cottage, where the sand, the gulf, and the serenity ensure your stay is nothing short of extraordinary.<br> <br>Welcome! Our dedicated team at Oversee 30A, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br> <br>Overview:<br>- 4 bedrooms, 4 bath<br>- 1826 square feet<br>- Elevator<br>- .3 miles to the Lupine Beach Access<br>- Wi-Fi/Roku TV<br>- Gulf views from the 3rd floor and gulf glimpses from the second floor<br>- Exterior has two sturdy hammocks<br>- 4 bikes included<br>- Private Pool/Shared Pool with its sister cottage (Hideaway Cottage)<br>- Dogs considered, an additional $210 nonrefundable fee for each dog<br> <br>Overnight:<br>- King in 2nd floor primary bedroom; private bath separate tub and shower; smart TV<br>- Queen in 2nd floor guest room; shared hall bath/ shower only; smart TV<br>- One twin XL over queen and one twin XL over twin XL bunks in 2nd floor guest room; shared hall bath/shower only; smart TV<br>- Queen sofa in 2nd floor living room; smart TV<br>- King in 3rd floor guest room; shared hall bath with private entry/ separate tub and shower; smart TV<br> <br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
