            "id": "345c5998-a3b1-4b0a-9f97-35ca6e3ad22a",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing your experience. We are so thrilled to hear of your spectacular experience. We are so glad the elevator brought so much enjoyment and ease. We hope to have you stay with us again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Place was spectacular. Layout was great, clean and within walking distance to the beach. The third floor has big windows that provide lots of sun for the morning and great views for sunsets. I highly recommend this place. Brought my 83 year mother, so the elevator was a big bonus.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
