        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Aug 26, 2025",
            "id": "df324604-d695-44de-811f-1b29c29556d3",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing your experience. We are thrilled you enjoyed our property and all it has to offer. It sounds like you all had a great time! We hope to have you stay with us again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Overall, we loved the house! It is very beachy! Beds were comfortable, bikes were great! Pool was awesome, proximity to the house! Beach access will improve once the construction is finished on the east side. We rode the bikes everyday and drove our jeep over to the beach access with our chairs and cooler.",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
