            "id": "519df78d-ace5-4f44-ac4f-38cbc7fcac5f",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for sharing your experience. We are thrilled that your family had plenty of space and that you enjoyed the elevator and laundry area. We will be sure to take a look around the outside to see if there is anything for us to tidy up. We hope to have you stay with us again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The amount of space fore our family was great. Elevator was great for husband who can’t do a lot of steps. Although it did stop between floors on the last day. outside could be a little more tidy. Laundry and mud area was great!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      },
      {
