            "id": "8abeca63-2bd7-47a6-87de-81a7b103c78d",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Hi Tabitha, thank you for sharing your experience at Mystic Cottage. We are thrilled you all enjoyed your last minute vacation/evacuation. Cleanliness and great communication are very important to us so we are thrilled to hear we accomplished that during your stay. We hope to host your next stay on 30A!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We booked this house last minute to evacuate during the hurricane in tampa and it turned out to be the perface safe space to land! The house was very clean, the property management was very responsive and helped with everything we needed! The location is perfect if you want ti be bear a nice quiet beach! Would definitely stay again!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
